370	// ── smem arena for the unpipelined engine. The M-atom-interleaved wgmma pipeline
371	//    (task #24, decoder H1+H3 port) stages kVitAtomsPerSlot A(64×16) tiles per
372	//    k-step (one per stacked m64 atom in an interleave GROUP, issued back-to-back
373	//    into independent fp32 fragments so the tensor pipe overlaps them; atom-in-
374	//    group ai at sA + ai·kVitTcSmemA1) + ONE shared B(N×16) tile. kVitAtomsPerSlot
375	//    = kVitMaxIL (the interleave cap, default 2). Plus the 256-float reduction slot
376	//    + the 10 dW specs (identical for all threads → shared, not per-thread stack).
377	//    16B-aligned. N = SG_TUNED_TILE_N. ──
